#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:10
msgid "Docker and composition."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:12
msgid ""
"All the docker configuration and files live in the `src/main/docker` "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:14
msgid ""
"The Docker image of NumaHOP is built in 2 stages first a `base` is "
"established. In this base we install the runtime dependencies of NumaHOP and "
"setup the system user that numahop will use."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:18
msgid ""
"Then a `run` stage is built. We setup the working directory for numahop and "
"the yaz library. This step is only needed to be run once as the rebuild "
"after changes in the source code of NumaHOP will reuse the latest `run` "
"image as a base."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:23
msgid ""
"This run stage will then be used by the jib maven plugin to install the "
"numahop build artifact inside the image. The new image is named `numahop` "
"and will have the tag `latest`."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:27
msgid ""
"The composition is declared with a compose file per service with toplevel "
"compose files that serve as aliases."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:30
msgid "Here is the list of services:"
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:31
msgid "`numahop-db`: the mariadb container."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:32
msgid "`numahop-es`: the elasticsearch container."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:33
msgid "`numahop-mail`: the mail container."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:34
msgid "`numahop-nh`: the numahop application container."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/docker_usage.md:36
msgid ""
"The two file aliases are `all` and `env`. `env` regroups the db, es, and "
"mail containers `all` adds to these the application container."
msgstr ""

